Third-party data

The catalogues embedded in the observation planning tools, and the services
the scripts query, are the work of others and carry their own terms and
citation requirements:

  Gaia DR3                     ESA / DPAC
  GCVS 5.1                     Sternberg Astronomical Institute, Moscow
  AAVSO VSX                    AAVSO
  VarAstro                     var.astro.cz
  TEPCat                       J. Southworth, Keele University
  NASA Exoplanet Archive       NASA / IPAC
  SkyBoT                       IMCCE / Observatoire de Paris
  Minor Planet Center          IAU / Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory
  Cantat-Gaudin open clusters  Vizier J/A+A/640/A1

If you publish results obtained with these tools, cite the underlying data
sources as those projects ask.
